  "notes": "{雇|やと}う is a godan verb meaning to hire or employ someone.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- Takes を particle: 〜を{雇|やと}う\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {社員|しゃいん}を{雇|やと}う: to hire an employee\n- アルバイトを{雇|やと}う: to hire a part-timer\n- {人|ひと}を{雇|やと}う: to hire someone\n- {正社員|せいしゃいん}として{雇|やと}う: to hire as a full-time employee\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- {雇用|こよう}: employment\n- {雇|やと}い{主|ぬし}: employer\n- {雇|やと}い{入|い}れる: to take on, hire\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {採用|さいよう}する: to hire (more formal, often for new graduates)\n- {解雇|かいこ}する: to fire, dismiss (opposite)",
